 - SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4703: The artifact `results/experiment_4703_held_out_first_win_readiness.json` must emit principle-annotated top-level fields for `honest_verdict`, `inference_substrate`, `verifier_is_oracle`, `first_win_rate_integrated`, `first_win_ci_lower`, `first_win_baseline`, `null_delta_methodology_note`, `positive_control_passed`, `multi_level_deepen_rate_integrated`, `parity_test_green`, `replay_package_floor_reproduced`, `replay_count_is_not_the_score`, `ready_for_operator_submit`, `random_seed`, `reproducibility_checksum`, and `preconditions_checked`. It must also include the Exp4605 proxy artifact path, the replay floor package path, no leaderboard submission, the parity test result, a replay-floor note, no live-game-server inference substrate, and spec refs. A flat first-win run must report `complete: held_out_first_win_flat_no_leaderboard_change`, emit the null-delta markers, set `positive_control_passed` only when parity and no-regression pass, and keep `replay_count_is_not_the_score=true` even when the replay package floor count exceeds 33.
 - SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4703-BLOCKED-PRECONDITION: If either submitted-agent import precondition fails, the Exp4605 module is not importable, the parity test fails, or the Exp4605 proxy cannot produce a readable first-win measurement, the workflow must write a terminal `blocked_<resource>` or `complete:` artifact with `ready_for_operator_submit=false`, `replay_count_is_not_the_score=true`, `submitted_to_leaderboard=false`, `positive_control_passed=false`, and the failed resource recorded in `preconditions_checked`; it must not submit to the leaderboard.
